THE WILL OF FIRE — AN INTRODUCTION
Konohagakure Office of the Hokage

The Will of Fire is the guiding philosophy of the Hidden Leaf, passed from the First Hokage Hashirama Senju through every generation since. It holds that the village is a family, and that a true shinobi of the Leaf protects and believes in the next generation, cherishing their comrades above personal gain.

Those who carry the Will of Fire treat the village as their family and are willing to lay down their lives to protect it and the future it represents. The Third Hokage, Hiruzen Sarutobi, was called "The Professor" and embodied this teaching throughout his long service.

As you begin your service, remember: strength without love for one's comrades is hollow. The tree that is Konoha grows only because each leaf shelters the ones below it.

Reflect on this teaching. It will be referenced throughout your career, from genin assignment to any future promotion.
